    조회버튼을 클릭하세요." multiline="1" ly_vert="0,4,222,32,1" />
		<BUTTON name="btnSearch" caption="조  회" fgcolor="065:102102102" fontsize="-2" ly_vert="307,4,64,32,1" />
		<CHKBUTTON name="chk2" chkcaption="Check" unchkcaption="UnCheck" ly_vert="235,643,100,32,1" />
